cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite sc-pcQTL using the metadata provided in this file."
title: "sc-pcQTL: single-cell principal-component QTL workflow"
abstract: >-
  Curated analysis code for sc-pcQTL, a single-cell RNA-seq framework that
  screens nearby gene pairs with a hurdle co-expression model, builds local
  gene clusters, summarizes each cluster as principal-component QTL (pcQTL)
  phenotypes, and compares them with single-gene eQTL and external-trait
  colocalization in the OneK1K cohort.
type: software
license: MIT
